# Job ingestion

- Discovery tools are intake only; Simplify owns company/role/url/date_applied/base status.
- Local repo owns resume_version, lanes, eligibility, sponsorship, auth Q&A, networking, next_action.
- Import must not overwrite local strategy fields or manual labels.
- Prefer company career URLs over aggregator URLs when both exist.
